Concrete/README.md:17:Each arrow is a total Lean function of the compiler. **Proved** means a kernel-checked theorem. **Premise** means a field of one of the two premise structures (frontend, native) in the one file `Concrete/Premises.lean`.
Concrete/README.md:25:  ▼                                   premise P_parse (implementation) until the generic theorem lands
