Concrete/README.md:199:- Each stage's definitions and theorems live in the same file, so each fact has one home.
Concrete/README.md:213:- **`Elab : Surface.Program → Core.Program → Prop`**, with the compiler's theorems `elab_fresh` (temporaries never collide with user names) and `elab_rename_invariant` (renaming temporaries changes neither acceptance nor outcome).
Concrete/README.md:220:- **`Denotes src p := ∃ toks ast, Lexes src toks ∧ Derives toks ast ∧ Elab ast p`.** Its theorem is `denotes_behaviour_det` (see the theorem section).
